atus ends that playback session.\n- Dark t"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"heme, 84/72/60 px responsive sizing, reduced-motion PNGs, offline embedding, and lifecycle cleanup r"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"x responsive sizing, reduced-motion PNGs, offline embedding, and lifecycle cleanup remain supported."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Removed in v0.7.0: Spout, Sonar, Tool Run, Stream, Calm, Retry, all generated art sources, and their"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"0: Spout, Sonar, Tool Run, Stream, Calm, Retry, all generated art sources, and their build pipeline."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart DSH or hard-refresh DSH Web after upgrading."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`npm run verify` regenerates only `assets/manifest.json` and `lib/client.js`; it never regenerates o"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"r re-encodes either original animation."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Release publication also runs the Chromium browser smoke test and stops if it fails."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"On Windows, run `check:browser` with Git Bash on `PATH` and set `CHROME_BIN` to the Chrome executabl"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e when Chrome is not on `PATH`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Runtime contract"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Property | Refined Dive | Classic |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Canvas | 352 × 352 | 184 × 184 |\n| Frames | "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"60 | 618 |\n| Frame duration | 33 ms | 17 ms |\n| Loop duration | 1.980 s | 10.506 s |\n| Source | byte"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"-preserved | byte-preserved |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The plugin is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek. See NOTICE.md."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"English · 简体中文"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
